## Optional onion service for a mirror (compose profile "onion").
DataDirectory /var/lib/tor
SocksPort 0
ClientOnly 1
ExitRelay 0
ExitPolicy reject *:*
Log notice stdout
SafeLogging 1

HiddenServiceDir /var/lib/tor/hs_web
HiddenServiceVersion 3
HiddenServicePort 80 unix:/run/onion/web.sock
HiddenServicePoWDefensesEnabled 1
HiddenServiceEnableIntroDoSDefense 1
HiddenServiceMaxStreams 200
HiddenServiceMaxStreamsCloseCircuit 1
